{"result":{"acceptance_year":null,"advert_code":"BK141105","advert_description":"Neplat\u00edte provizi RK: Nab\u00edz\u00edm k pron\u00e1jmu novostavbu skladov\u011b-v\u00fdrobn\u00ed haly 1100 m2 s t\u0159\u00edpodla\u017en\u00ed administrativn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstavbou 570 m2 a pozemkem cca 1100 m2 v pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9 z\u00f3n\u011b v Brn\u011b. Hala m\u00e1 rozm\u011bry 55 x 20 m, bezpra\u0161n\u00e9 podlahy, v\u00fd\u0161ku 10 m, vjezd sek\u010dn\u00edmi vraty v \u00farovni ter\u00e9nu 4,5x4,5 m, vyt\u00e1p\u011bn\u00ed plynov\u00fdmi infraz\u00e1\u0159i\u010di a p\u0159\u00edprava pro je\u0159\u00e1bovou dr\u00e1hu s nosnost\u00ed 10 t. Na hala navazuje t\u0159\u00edpodla\u017en\u00ed administrativn\u00ed budova 3x190 m2, se z\u00e1zem\u00edm v p\u0159\u00edzem\u00ed, kancel\u00e1\u0159emi v prvn\u00ed a druh\u00e9m pat\u0159e. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed haly je venkovn\u00ed zpevn\u011bn\u00e1 manipula\u010dn\u00ed plocha cca 1100 m2 s parkovac\u00edmi m\u00edsty. \r\n\r\nVyt\u00e1p\u011bn\u00ed tepeln\u00fdm \u010derpadlem umo\u017e\u0148uje tak\u00e9 chlazen\u00ed haly a v kombinaci s FVE v\u00fdrazn\u011b optimalizuje v\u00fddaje na energie.  Mapa nemus\u00ed zobrazovat p\u0159esnou polohu nemovitosti. \r\n\r\nPro zasl\u00e1n\u00ed podrobn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch informac\u00ed vypl\u0148te pros\u00edm kontaktn\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159 u inzer\u00e1tu a p\u0159ipojte stru\u010dn\u00e9 p\u0159edstaven\u00ed va\u0161\u00ed firmy/(I\u010c) a z\u00e1m\u011br vyu\u017eit\u00ed prostor. Tyto \u00fadaje mi pomohou ov\u011b\u0159it vhodnost nab\u00eddky pro va\u0161e pot\u0159eby a zaslat v\u00e1m co nejd\u0159\u00edve v\u0161echny detaily.\r\n\r\nT\u011b\u0161\u00edm se na v\u00e1\u0161 z\u00e1jem a na mo\u017enost v\u00e1m pomoci naj\u00edt ide\u00e1ln\u00ed prostory! Pokud jste si nevybrali z uve\u0159ejn\u011bn\u00e9 nab\u00eddky, zadejte n\u00e1m pros\u00edm Va\u0161i popt\u00e1vku a my se pokus\u00edme naj\u00edt odpov\u00eddaj\u00edc\u00ed nemovitost.","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":1007853026,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JD9RxnGoBHmrPS9/ccb7.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981175279,"kind":2,"order":4,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/nPYADvcUkmBFAg3CMfHmrPTs/1eb0.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981175282,"kind":2,"order":5,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JBuatXCfqHmrPUd/ecc1.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981175285,"kind":2,"order":6,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JCNF9HJdPHmrPVN/6edd.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981176047,"kind":2,"order":7,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JYnYGIR6HmrPV9/889a.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981176050,"kind":2,"order":8,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/nPYADvcUkmCfYovB9AHmrPWu/8511.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981176056,"kind":2,"order":9,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JBdV1WIgDHmrPXf/96e6.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":981176059,"kind":2,"order":10,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JCNF9HJfEHmrPYO/ab82.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":1007853038,"kind":2,"order":11,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/nPYADvcUkmBcG9PCGqHmrPZE/728f.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":1007853041,"kind":2,"order":12,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/nPYADvcUkmDNojLCIQHmrPZt/af56.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":1007853044,"kind":2,"order":13,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/kPVqmweP7JYnYGH9cHmrPab/b8f2.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":1440,"id":1007853047,"kind":2,"order":14,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qE_D/nPYADvcUkmBzBfmHUrHmrPbI/0813.jpeg","width":1920},{"ai_edited":